{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51410","headline":"平望驿寄吴兴徐使君玄之〖1〗 · 张祜","name":"平望驿寄吴兴徐使君玄之〖1〗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人爲作郡，百里到吴兴。\n藻思江湖满，公平道路称。\n包山方峻直，霅水况澄清。\n伫听司空第，遥知下诏徵。\n（《百城烟水》四《吴江》）（〖1〗《嘉泰吴兴志》卷十四《郡守题名》云：「徐玄之，开元七年自谏议大夫授，改邠王府长史。\n《统纪》云：开元十五年。\n」郁贤皓《唐刺史考》从《统纪》之说。\n张祜约生於贞元间，卒於大中中，於徐玄之不同时，诗显非其作。\n确作者不详，姑仍存此。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}